  lines:
  - speaker: Player
    text: So you're the victim's assistant? How close are you?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Assistant
    text: I help him with pretty much everything from getting his laundry to scheduling
      his meetings.
